<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ use Vertex\Core\View;
$sel = static fn (string $a, string $b): string => $a === $b ? ' selected' : ''; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Referral partners</p><h1>Referrals</h1></div><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/referrals/dashboard">Dashboard</a></div>
<form method="get" action="/referrals" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="Reference, prospect, partner" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="s">Status</label><select id="s" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('referrals.referral_statuses') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['status'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="a">Attribution</label><select id="a" name="attribution"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('referrals.attribution_labels') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['attribution'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="from">From</label><input id="from" name="from" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['from']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">To</label><input id="to" name="to" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['to']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="duplicates" value="1"<?= $filters['duplicates'] ? ' checked' : '' ?>> Duplicate claims only</label></div><div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Referral</th><th>Prospect</th><th>Partner</th><th>Status</th><th>Credit</th><th>Submitted</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <?php foreach ($rows as $r) : ?><tr><td><a href="/referrals/<?= e($r['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($r['reference']) ?></strong></a><?= $r['duplicate_status'] === 'suspected' ? ' <span class="badge badge-pending">Duplicate?</span>' : '' ?></td><td><?= e($r['prospect_name']) ?><br><span class="muted"><?= e($r['business_name'] ?? '') ?></span></td>
        <td><?= e($r['partner_name']) ?></td><td><?= View::partial('pbadge', ['kind' => 'referral', 's' => $r['status']]) ?></td><td><?= e(config("referrals.attribution_labels.{$r['attribution']}", $r['attribution'])) ?><?= $r['attribution_locked'] ? ' 🔒' : '' ?></td><td><?= e(local_time($r['created_at'], 'd M Y')) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
    <?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="6" class="muted">No referrals match.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
